        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI EP1272 Contemporary Round Fingertip Edge Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClean contemporary design round door edge pull. This sliding door edge pull is pressure mounted into the doors edge for a super clean installation (no screws). Just drill the 1\" hole (keep the hole tight), apply a small amount of adhesive and tap the edge pull in place.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors--any door where a \"flush with the door face\" small finger pull is desired. Can be used in the doors edge or  on the door face. Has a lip for your finger to grab when used as a pocket door edge pull.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AHI EP1272 Round Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 1-1/8\" (29 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Diameter: 1\" (24 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Inside Diameter (where you put your finger): 3/4\" (19 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 13/16\" (21 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
